    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0A high-energy 3D platformer\u00a0Collect-a-thon inspired by classic genre hits, starring the bold android girl Rey, who switches abilities using the cartridges on her head!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Freely explore a vast and vibrant world at your own pace, and break free from the grip of the laboratory!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/73406d57063292af35a878e3fab8ab59.poster.avif?t=1749836120\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/73406d57063292af35a878e3fab8ab59.webm?t=1749836120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/73406d57063292af35a878e3fab8ab59.mp4?t=1749836120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the lab's clutches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between cartridges to transform gameplay and movement!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all mysterious Disks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore colorful and whimsical locations filled with humorous characters and witty moments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it seems the lab\u2019s shadow follows us, even after we\u2019ve escaped...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/9e694291122cbf8c1ba1b8d814365c06.poster.avif?t=1749836120\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/9e694291122cbf8c1ba1b8d814365c06.webm?t=1749836120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/9e694291122cbf8c1ba1b8d814365c06.mp4?t=1749836120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0b <strong>CARTRIDGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Equip unique cartridges to gain new abilities! <br>\u00a0 Switch between them on the fly to adapt to the environment or solve platforming challenges. <br>\u00a0 Each cartridge alters Rey\u2019s movement and even the world around her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/b32895e3e2a9051203cc070e23df1967.poster.avif?t=1749836120\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/b32895e3e2a9051203cc070e23df1967.webm?t=1749836120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/b32895e3e2a9051203cc070e23df1967.mp4?t=1749836120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0A high-energy 3D platformer\u00a0Collect-a-thon inspired by classic genre hits, starring the bold android girl Rey, who switches abilities using the cartridges on her head!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Freely explore a vast and vibrant world at your own pace, and break free from the grip of the laboratory!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/73406d57063292af35a878e3fab8ab59.poster.avif?t=1749836120\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/73406d57063292af35a878e3fab8ab59.webm?t=1749836120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/73406d57063292af35a878e3fab8ab59.mp4?t=1749836120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the lab's clutches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between cartridges to transform gameplay and movement!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all mysterious Disks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore colorful and whimsical locations filled with humorous characters and witty moments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it seems the lab\u2019s shadow follows us, even after we\u2019ve escaped...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798840/extras/9e694291122cbf8c1ba1b8d814365c06.poster.avif?t=1749836120\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https